#: crates/core/src/oars.rs:185
msgid "Gambling using real money"
msgstr "असली पैसे से जुआ"

#: crates/core/src/oars.rs:191
msgid "No ability to spend money"
msgstr "पैसे खर्च करने की कोई सुविधा नहीं"

#: crates/core/src/oars.rs:192
msgid "Users are encouraged to donate real money"
