#: crates/core/src/oars.rs:244
msgid "No sharing of physical location with other users"
msgstr "अन्य उपयोगकर्ताओं के साथ भौतिक स्थान साझा नहीं किया जाता"

#: crates/core/src/oars.rs:247
msgid "Sharing physical location with other users"
